{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7b/ou4u07s2m7cbhdu334ap3a9vucwkqr8.mp3","text":"让我干这么无聊的事？......好吧，看在你这个人还算有趣的份上，陪你一次。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8e/kg2lrip543atpdnhhrs9zp3grfflyzi.mp3","text":"要搬东西的话别找我。我才不是那种丰蹄。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/14/jnmeeir31l4ogybpp2p5epdk9rw7xxi.mp3","text":"这仪器的构造可真精密......看起来眼熟？对了，如果那个叫梅尔的找过来，别告诉她我在这里。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/59/n9li4ke5l6az5f601bxdh4akpa070gf.mp3","text":"没见过我背后这种装置？过来，把手放在这里......哈哈哈哈！看你那狼狈的样子！你问喷出来的是什么？就是水咯。至于水之外还加了什么东西，嘁，不告诉你。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:0/00/qas7818d467v8oqujycgn0qtgrogizm.mp3","text":"我对帮助别人不感兴趣。但效率的提升对所有人来说都是好事。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fe/692yn4mb8ys5to8j4oee46bg3unzqcc.mp3","text":"战斗结束得更快了，倒是个好消息。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:3/31/ashs4nygi2uyzafem649hcpx7vslhrb.mp3","text":"蛋糕？软绵绵，没意思。唔......上面这颗盐渍梅果味道还不错。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a5/ebqt5hnpm874xp4rs0tglmupyis8rfa.mp3","text":"船上没雨，废话，我当然知道。可外面就不一定了。啧，等风暴到来的时候，记得靠近点，你会感谢我手里拿着它的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/11/ic5r2993q6gjilkfb8g9yuqtulbp6bm.mp3","text":"喂，想不想去沙漠一日游？我带你。去别的地方也可以。只要带上我的多功能喷气背包，跟着风的味道走......啧啧，像我这么优秀的向导，你赚翻了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b1/r21uxqn2ew67auwgb9km4gl2e990h3x.mp3","text":"没动静？那我可以试试这招了，水流更劲，喷洒面积更大......可不许抱怨哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:9/96/otoy4ktaskihitpv26ldfa3o6arn6hd.mp3","text":"博士？他们说在这里你懂得比谁都多，那我可要好好看看。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b4/i4pt2jkbc1k5kikn3sj9vn5eyi4gcpt.mp3","text":"和穿越沙漠一样，战斗也用不上经验。只需要想活下去的本能。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:3/37/ejmfmt4ycc03008rg1evrfk3y62otf6.mp3","text":"这晋升徽章也没什么别的功能了啊，没劲。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e5/gevlx1ibo390kmfaeakzqiqoalu5f4v.mp3","text":"医疗方面的专家？真是没想到。总之都是确保任务完成是吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:8/85/1i34vkdjg1qwwhbmz62p8ldi98lpcrs.mp3","text":"又要出外勤？好吧，回来帮我试新装备。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:9/95/kr1k5uro59s7q8ialjjbhjcxtrkubsw.mp3","text":"带队作战和当向导差别不大。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:4/45/azw199zodpkmkiar95lckrkv0lg71a8.mp3","text":"路线合理，装备正常，出发。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/6ix9k8748cz48ljbvgrt00t0yo7xvoa.mp3","text":"比遇上风沙还要无聊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/5hbw2kdo8goof2iq1gycfo6518jbei2.mp3","text":"有事就说。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d2/l5gxcp5th4h4tf9aettgt4kppdoc9ot.mp3","text":"我在思考......","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5b/df6nq20d395sacntjkbgjmr5nmbrxi9.mp3","text":"很好，效率将会提升17%。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a9/6m0n9w2zb5w8xg4kkqlabohq3ip8nmj.mp3","text":"得快些行动了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a6/pd43m9exkbtzcncavykn4psc2288fdw.mp3","text":"再快一些。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/65/n3ur3wopeturpzgqlcwv8rfonneyfbm.mp3","text":"试试新改的装备。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4f/sy4u5c90xzvhcupygl8ie4fhtoouqmp.mp3","text":"新款营养液味道如何？","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/da/iw6pan6ps7007jkh4mnsnyjgslqmg22.mp3","text":"风的味道变了......","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/29/jahj0zoa9bbnq506mc8i2ozrt2t4tjg.mp3","text":"嘁，我见过的风沙比这个厉害多了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:4/46/b52l3fbr8dkd6407jyyz04mettz3cvo.mp3","text":"马马虎虎吧，还不算浪费时间。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c2/t48tqcfpmq2vamfprsq8y677bup8n78.mp3","text":"效率不够，回去试试调整装备，或许再换个试剂。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cc/l9cu68d86dux4x1kvhe73rnxo7yurr4.mp3","text":"至少选了合格的撤退路线......","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:9/98/tb5gdgkpqa8wtfu3j1z2kbfp938br0o.mp3","text":"原来有这么多房间......","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/b1xwfq57wre4qfwt2rtzj2m5k28kt85.mp3","text":"别这么无聊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4d/lw2k0nm31upoqd6no608gj0dvpmhi8m.mp3","text":"要不要再摸一下我的背包？这回会避开你的脸，我保证。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/0mz0z4lt0hfqc7di5l0xnu18coixetf.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:3/34/j7f20dk8obokzmfpphhqk1spyxjrewh.mp3","text":"新年快乐，新的一年也请多多指教。好，说完了。很标准吧？你开心就好——奖金？给我的？你认真的？唔......谢谢，新年快乐。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:4/49/4om1yhpgc1gnhf0n5oonkxap0oyimnj.mp3","text":"外面天气不错，又下雨了呢，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_402_tuye/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e5/1a50ivboqzlxwmjypke6g24rh73ujs6.mp3","text":"让我干这么无聊的事？......好吧，看在你这个人还算有趣的份上，陪你一次。","alt":"voice/char_402_tuye/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e3/g9jjlawlznukx35cw7rxzb6nwxjkvpz.mp3","text":"要搬东西的话别找我。我才不是那种丰蹄。","alt":"voice/char_402_tuye/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/02/bw4i393s4tt0rqgkyl221cfypy9yunb.mp3","text":"这仪器的构造可真精密......看起来眼熟？对了，如果那个叫梅尔的找过来，别告诉她我在这里。","alt":"voice/char_402_tuye/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/60/sqm7hp6cexzle8uzpwj4w3cxz7o7ml5.mp3","text":"没见过我背后这种装置？过来，把手放在这里......哈哈哈哈！看你那狼狈的样子！你问喷出来的是什么？就是水咯。至于水之外还加了什么东西，嘁，不告诉你。","alt":"voice/char_402_tuye/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/6vsw47k13kw5v6y3q19t1rna5hyisgu.mp3","text":"我对帮助别人不感兴趣。但效率的提升对所有人来说都是好事。","alt":"voice/char_402_tuye/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/29/dgvd4vl4grtmkvlk1lv71kkmjwhc8m3.mp3","text":"战斗结束得更快了，倒是个好消息。","alt":"voice/char_402_tuye/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4b/ekkrtdhogjzam1ctn4llfh4khuk003r.mp3","text":"蛋糕？软绵绵，没意思。唔......上面这颗盐渍梅果味道还不错。","alt":"voice/char_402_tuye/cn_007.mp3